{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Quiet.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You'd let the void take you but you find yourself thrust into somewhere worse. Awake.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][PIERCING FLUORESCENT RAYS sear your corneas. Your tongue, a shriveled lump of meat in the back of your throat tasting faintly...][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Metallic?][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Another day of this precious thing we call life.][/nomarkup]
