{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The non-stop cacophony pounds at your head like a sledgehammer.][/nomarkup] 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You barely manage to sit up. Your limbs are stiff as if suspended in a thick, viscous goo.][/nomarkup]
<<PlaySFX "phone_ring">>
RING! RING! RING!
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your clock reads 8pm. That's late? Can't be right but last night's events evade you.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You can't concentrate past your senses. The taste lingers. Whatever you had you're craving more.][/nomarkup]
<<PlaySFX "phone_ring">>
RING! RING! RING!
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Whatever it is can wait.][/nomarkup]
